         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">installation, operating, C, CT, CWTF Series Instalaltion &amp; Operating Guide</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Installation &amp; Operating Guide for the C, CT, CWTF Series including the DV, APS/TC/TS, Single CW &amp; Twins.  This equipment will brew one or two half-gallon batches of coffee simultaneously into awating dispensers (with just a press of a button).  One side may include a hot water faucet for allied beverage use.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
